{
  "_about": "Resume templates for Tools/resume_render.py. A template changes only the layout and look (font, sizes, colours, spacing, heading and employer styles). The content and section titles are the same in every template. Colours are hex RGB without '#', or 'accent'/'muted' for the template's own colours. Sizes are points, margins inches. min_body_pt is the smallest body size auto-fit (resume_render.py --pages) may use. Spacing is set with fixed gaps (gap_stack_pt, gap_employer_pt), not empty lines, and every template keeps employer headers with their content across page breaks.",

